[auto_map_race_node-4] tells the localizer the car starts there (there is no RViz on the
[auto_map_race_node-4] car to click a start pose), and it only searches about 0.5 m and
[auto_map_race_node-4] 20 deg around it. Mark the spot (tape on the floor) before you move
[auto_map_race_node-4] the car, and you can race this map again on any later day.
